Z||000009||otis||02-29-2000||04:34 PM||||Thanks members for the replys. I went to<BR>two other mom and pop shops and could not<BR>find anyone to take on the installation of<BR>the flowmaster. My budget is 250.00 so that<BR>leaves me with only one option due to the<BR>various  shops unwillingness to do  any<BR>fabrication. I ordered the Gorlic system<BR>from F.S. When I go  to Florida for the<BR>DAytona meet I am going talk to some of the<BR>heavy weights about putting a good kit to-<BR>gether that will allow the installation of<BR>good quality  mufflers.||||reg||14
Z||000010||Raydar||02-29-2000||04:35 PM||||I installed the IRM "resonators only" exhaust on my Formula. It was "most" obnoxious. Not that it was too loud (although it WAS loud), it's just the pitch that it hit. Made my hair hurt, and my eyeballs vibrate. Ended up adding a bullet glasspack, after the cat. Sounds a lot better, although the neighbors still give me ugly looks.||||reg||1
Z||000011||Alex4mula||02-29-2000||04:43 PM||||Me too once had only resonators with no muffler nor cat. Added later the glass pack (sherry bomb). Good performance but still too loud for the gain. After 2 years it rusted and was very happy put back the original muffler. I'm lookng for the Borla but hope it is not as loud.||||reg||1
Z||000012||1FST2M6||02-29-2000||09:43 PM||||I had an Ocelot exhaust on my car but didn't see any gain in HP or Torque over the stock unit (sold it to fellow Fiero owner here in Atlanta) I had a local muffler shop make my current set up for $169  it's 2.5" mandrel bent stainless in to a 2.5" 2 chamber flowmaster then a single out again 2.5" to a decent looking 4" 5Zidgen stainless tip. Then my cat was replaced 2.5" Random Technology unit. $315 (OUCH) The addition of the new 2.5" piping, flowmaster and cat showed 11hp and 17lbft at the wheels! (measured on a Dynojet Model 248) Both RAYDAR and BlackGT have heard my car.. not to loud in the car... a bit more than stock and you don't have to YELL at your passenger to have a conversation. ||||reg||1
Z||000013||AL||02-29-2000||10:26 PM||||hey bruce how much do you want for your flowmaster?||||reg||1
